# Coloring two tasks in the outline, then recoloring one in the Colors view moves it from group to group with the focus, and the file keeps one color tag each.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Call the plumber
	- Renew passport
END
keys j mc 1 j mc 2 gC gg
see Red
keys mc 2
see Yellow
hide Red
keys mc 4
see Blue
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Call the plumber @blue
	- Renew passport @yellow
END
